[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     66[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     67[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// `OP_FN(OP)` -- `CAT(op_, OP)`, the selected operation function.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     68[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ///
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     69[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Kept as an `extern "C" fn` value so that both the direct call in
