[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    181[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ///
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    182[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// The C macros chain: `REP3` expands to `REP2` plus `STEP_OP(op, acc, 2)`, so
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    183[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// `REP<n>` applies `STEP_OP` once for each `i` in `0..n` with the literal index
