[38;5;10mDISPATCH_REP[0m's [38;5;10mswitch[0m covers only cases 0–6 even though [38;5;10mREP7[0m exists, so with [38;5;10m-DREPEAT=7[0m the [38;5;10mdefault:[0m arm fires and [38;5;10muse_generated[0m reports just the initial accumulator ([38;5;10mgen.acc=1[0m for [38;5;10mmul[0m, not [38;5;10m5040[0m). That's a real asymmetry in the header; I reproduced it rather than fixing it, and the C reference confirms it.[0m[0m
